	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"viewend"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat020020"},
		line=686,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Nnh...”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"The air-rending explosion finally subsides.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"The smoke and dust clouding my vision are slowly swept away by the wind.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Everywhere I look, I spot the faint outlines of wailing guests who were merrily chatting away mere seconds ago.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"Many are no longer moving.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Nng... ghh...”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"Beside me, I hear the soft groans of a young woman.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"It's Empress Hisui.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"I rush over to her in a panic and hold her up in my arms.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Your Majesty. Your Majesty!”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Your Majesty, speak to me!”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"My arms are slick with blood.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"I just hope she isn't grievously injured...",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Nn...”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"She slowly blinks her eyes open.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“C... Colonel... What just...”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It looks like there's been an explosion.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“An explosion?”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Empress Hisui casts her gaze around and gasps at the sight.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We need to treat your wounds.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“These are mere scratches. You needn't worry yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Empress Hisui's declares in a firm voice.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"I'd thought her a sheltered wallflower, but she has quite a strong will about her.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I am relieved to hear that.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“In that case, I shall go assess the situation.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Please wait!”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"As I move to stand, she holds me back by my sleeve.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“You are bleeding.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"Only after she mentions it do I notice the trickle of blood running down my leg.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"Empress Hisui immediately begins deftly tearing strips of cloth from her own raiments.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"With practiced movements, she moves to bandage my wounds.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You seem used to this.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I have studied this in the past.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Hupsy...”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"She wraps a tight binding around an artery to occlude the flow of blood.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Her technique is easily on par with that of professional Army medics.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"She clearly didn't learn all of this from study alone.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"Could the Empress of all people possibly have practical experience in first aid?",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“There. This should be suitable for a while.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Do, however, make sure to see a physician soon. This was merely first aid.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Thank you... very much.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"As I stare at her dumbfoundedly, Empress Hisui smoothly wipes the sweat off her brow.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"This caged bird of an Empress is wearing a radiant smile that I find entirely incongruous.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"It's a vivacious and carefree smile, a smile that deserves to be basking freely beneath the sun's rays.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"No, this isn't the time to be captivated.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Someone, give me a sitrep now!”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"I call out on the radio.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"Immediately, the panicked voice of a signal officer urgently summarizes the devastation of the ceremony venue.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"According to the report, explosions broke out in three separate locations.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"They took out not just the venue itself, but also an enormous chunk of the palace walls and several of our armored vehicles.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"It seems some sort of explosive devices were planted well in advance.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"The casualties have yet to be determined.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Considering that a follow-up attack hasn't materialized,\nit's likely that the explosions were an act of terrorism by anti-government dissidents.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"I've been awake since yesterday morning searching for any suspicious activities, and this is what it all comes to?",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Evacuating the civilians is our top priority.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“One platoon should remain on high alert in case of another attack.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Report anything out of the ordinary immediately.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"I cut off my transmission.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Whatever may have happened?”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That's what I'm trying to find out.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"A leisurely set of footfalls approach us from behind.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Are you unharmed, Empress Hisui?”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Okonogi appears, flanked by an entourage of his Forbidden Guard.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"The light vanishes in an instant from Empress Hisui's face.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Indeed, all thanks to the Colonel.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“My, my, Elsa-sama. How unexpected to see you here.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"He puts up a sniveling display of humility upon noticing my presence.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Your Highness, I am pleased to see that you are unharmed.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"Okonogi turns and bows deeply to Empress Hisui.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"Empress Hisui merely returns this gesture with a small, silent incline of her head.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Chancellor, please accompany Her Majesty somewhere safe.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Very well, ma'am.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"Okonogi languidly turns and issues an order to the Forbidden Guards behind him.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"His lack of urgency grates on my nerves.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"There could very well be another attack at any moment.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Colonel, you ought to withdraw as we─”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Empress Hisui clasps my hand in hers.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I have my orders. I'll need to stay here.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“But...”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“It is as Elsa-sama says.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Ensuring Your Majesty's safety is our utmost priority.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Say what you mean for once...”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"The wind carries what she murmurs under her breath clearly to my ears.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“I beg your pardon, Your Majesty?”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Come now, we must withdraw with haste. Leave the rest to the soldiers.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"I know Empress Hisui is nothing but Okonogi's puppet.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"That exchange just now is probably a rather commonplace one.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Um, Colonel!”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If it pleases you, you may call me Elsa.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Very well, Elsa-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I offer you my utmost gratitude for coming to my aid despite your injuries.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“It was most reassuring to have you there by my side.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"She tightly clasps my hand in both of hers.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“My mission was to prevent an incident like this from occurring in the first place.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Please accept my deepest apologies for having ruined the ceremony.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Your sense of fealty is most admirable.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Empress Hisui's eyes, filled with a respectful reverence, peer into mine.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"This concept of “fealty” that the warriors talk about so much─I confess that I don't quite understand it.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"By and large, it seems to refer to loyalty in carrying out your duty, but there's an additional aspect to it based on your personal sense of idealism.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I have little with which to return your favor, but it would please me if you might accept this.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"She places a small woodwork trinket in my hand.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"In the Republic, we'd call it a “keychain.” In the Empire, however, I believe it would be known as a “netsuke.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"...",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"Honestly, I haven't done anything worthy of gratitude.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Is she just the conscientious type, or could it be that she's trying to get close to me?",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"I can't figure out her intentions, but it wouldn't do to turn her down.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I shall receive it with gratitude.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Empress Hisui shows me a cheery smile tinged with a slight shade of relief.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"It's the same bright smile I saw when she was bandaging my wounds.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"A caged bird, huh?",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"What thoughts might be running through her head as she dances on Okonogi's strings?",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"I'd thought her just a pitiful little girl, but I find myself more and more interested in her character.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Now then, back to work.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"I mutter this to myself and return to my duties as a soldier.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"The enemy may still be lurking in the vicinity.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"The status of all the attendees hasn't been confirmed, either.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"I shove the netsuke into my pocket and run to meet my subordinates.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"After completing my preliminary investigation, I head to the Government-General to deliver my report.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"My father Warren, sitting in front of me, looks the same as ever.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Allow me to present my report.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Three simultaneous explosions were set off at different locations in the ceremony venue.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We believe that some sort of explosive devices were set up beforehand.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We are proceeding under the assumption that this was an act of terrorism against Empress Hisui and the dignitaries present, but the perpetrator remains unknown.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Next, the damage report.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Five Republican guests were injured, and as for the Empi─”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Enough. I can read the report myself.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"He sternly taps the documents on his desk.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“This has become quite the predicament.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Those guests were invited from the mainland under my auspices.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“And now...”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"He mimes an explosion with his hands.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Look at what's happened.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“You can only imagine the groundwork it took to invite them here.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“My deepest apologies.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“No need to apologize.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“An apology from you won't change anything at this point.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“The time I spent, the money I used, the favors I called in, the face I lost... All gone to waste. Every last bit of it.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"My father leans heavily against the back of his chair.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"He proceeds to methodically pack tobacco into his pipe and coolly breathes out a puff of smoke.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"I remain standing there as the minutes tick by.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"He refuses to break the silence, forcing me to reflect on my failure.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"I was the one in charge of security for the Armistice Day ceremony.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"All the responsibility clearly falls on my shoulders, with no two ways about it.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Was this the handiwork of the warriors?”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“There is no evidence of that.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Based on past experience, they aren't ones to use explosives.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“We'll pin it on the warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But that...”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“They're the ones that did it.”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"My father sets down his pipe.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Whenever you conquer a country, there's sure to be a resistance movement.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“They are a mold trying to take root in the country.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“No matter how hard you clean, they'll grow right back if you miss even a little.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“If you want to get rid of mold, you have to work thoroughly, until every last bit is exterminated.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Countries that properly cleanse their blight run smoothly, and the ones that don't are consumed by civil war.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“What do you want to happen to the Empire?”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I want to govern it stably as a new Republican territory.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Then you have your answer.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But the Republic is meant to fight to liberate the oppressed from tyranny.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“And so isn't it wrong to oppress the warriors as a means to that end?”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"I know all too well that “liberating populaces from tyranny” is just a pretext.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"The wars we fight are nothing more than a means for politicians and arms dealers to expand their influence and line their pockets.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"But in order to pull the wool over the eyes of the voters, you need to give them a just cause to rally behind.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Your viewpoints are only ever worth as much as the results you can back them up with.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“If I've made myself clear, you are dismissed.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Sir.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"I do an about-face and head for the door.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"Without results, my viewpoints are worthless.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"I hate to admit it, but that man has a point.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"History is written only by the victors, and we losers will go down in history with our viewpoints forever unheard.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"But even so, I'd rather die than give up on my convictions.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"Tainted as I am by my father's money, this life of mine is hardly worth all that much in the first place.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
